1. The AI upscaling model (referenced and downloaded, not distributed)
================================================================================

"4xTextureDAT2_otf" by Philip Hofmann (Phhofm)
  https://github.com/Phhofm/models
  https://openmodeldb.info/models/4x-TextureDAT2-otf
Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license
(CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The HD texture tool does not include the model. The player downloads it from
the author's release page (tools/tex/INSTALL_HD.txt gives the URL and its
SHA-256), and it is used unmodified, on the player's PC, to upscale textures
from the player's own copy of the game. Neither the model nor the upscaled
textures are distributed by this project.


