================================================================================
5. Used, but neither distributed nor linked
================================================================================

RPCS3 (GPL-2.0, https://rpcs3.net). The developer tools read import-function
names from the developer's own rpcs3.exe at run time (tools/imports.py; the
cache is git-ignored), and developers use rpcs3.exe to decrypt their own
executable. The retired RPCS3 version of the project (a patch file in RPCS3's
patch format and a PINE IPC client, both in the git history) used RPCS3 the
same way. No RPCS3 code is included.

Font. The overlay artwork in tools/boot/assets contains text rasterized in
Bahnschrift, a font that ships with Windows. Only the developer command
`bootscreen.py render-overlay`, which regenerates those images, loads the font
(from the Windows fonts folder). The font file is not distributed.
